{"id":"n72136-1-16","stage":3,"title":"축제 · 庆典","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72136-1-16-1","ko":"오늘 저녁에 한강에서 불꽃 축제가 열린답니다.","zh":"今天晚上汉江上要举办烟花节哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}},{"text":"한강에서","meaning":"汉江","explanation":"한강：汉江；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"한강에서","audio":"/audio/393101805ad2faefc466.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한강에서","audio":"/audio/393101805ad2faefc466.mp3"}},{"text":"불꽃","meaning":"火光，火焰","explanation":"불꽃：火光，火焰","readings":[{"term":"불꽃","audio":"/audio/9e9a2d3a41ba8bc6acd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60571","senseId":"1","lemma":"불꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불꽃","audio":"/audio/9e9a2d3a41ba8bc6acd1.mp3"}},{"text":"축제가","meaning":"庆典","explanation":"축제：庆典；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"축제","audio":"/audio/0bf538f6ba0e7895d423.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72136","senseId":"1","lemma":"축제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축제가","audio":"/audio/7a48f57b38268230cb25.mp3"}},{"text":"열린답니다.","meaning":"召开，举行","explanation":"열리다：召开，举行；ㄴ답니다：礼貌地告知自己知道或听说的事实。","readings":[{"term":"열리다","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74352","senseId":"2","lemma":"열리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열린답니다","audio":"/audio/049584b80d897e75662f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"9e9a2d3a41ba8bc6","term":"불꽃","zh":"火光，火焰","audio":"/audio/9e9a2d3a41ba8bc6acd1.mp3","entryId":"60571","definition":"燃烧的火中散发出的红光。","pronunciation":["불꼳"]},{"id":"0bf538f6ba0e7895","term":"축제","zh":"庆典","audio":"/audio/0bf538f6ba0e7895d423.mp3","entryId":"72136","definition":"为纪念或祝贺某事而举行的大规模仪式。","pronunciation":["축쩨"]},{"id":"b6ba3a226396d7d0","term":"열리다","zh":"召开，举行","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3","entryId":"74352","definition":"聚会或会议开始。","pronunciation":["열리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/214b10d8d29d46104f87.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72136-1-16-2","ko":"우리도 가서 다른 사람들이랑 같이 구경하고 놀아요.","zh":"我们也去和别人一起看烟花、玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이랑","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이랑","audio":"/audio/dd199af46b9e9d9e6b33.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"구경하고","meaning":"观看，观赏，看热闹","explanation":"구경하다：观看，观赏，看热闹；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"구경하다","audio":"/audio/a9fade8f610f2f6c2fec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62355","senseId":"1","lemma":"구경하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구경하고","audio":"/audio/f8b861b5d6e6b6ceb282.mp3"}},{"text":"놀아요.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀아요","audio":"/audio/5ded521f7bcbc7326b73.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"a9fade8f610f2f6c","term":"구경하다","zh":"观看，观赏，看热闹","audio":"/audio/a9fade8f610f2f6c2fec.mp3","entryId":"62355","definition":"带着兴趣或关心看。","pronunciation":["구ː경하다"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ab5f3be5a46839501ae.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.222,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72136","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8196,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天晚上汉江上要举办烟花节哦。","我们也去和别人一起看烟花、玩吧。","姐姐怎么总是这么晚才回来啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天晚上汉江上要举办烟花节哦。","我们也去和别人一起看烟花、玩吧。","姐姐怎么总是这么晚才回来啊？"],"answer":1}]}
